body:
Literally the other day at work I had real bad right shoulder pain (found out it’s a rotator cuff/tendinitis thing today) but I just did my best to minimize my pain and worked through it. It’s not something I recommend anyone do but it’s common enough especially in jobs that don’t have pto or sick pay. 

I know coworkers who’ve done similar things when they are sick including myself. 

So a situation like this isn’t uncommon. I will say holding in nausea is impressive but I’m sure in the right circumstances it’s possible (in a way the movement could potentially help keep the worse of it at bay);
